nt to show you who he was, and how his life changed us. Can we walk here together for a while?\"\n\nA videogame developer's love letter to his son; a memorial to Joel Green; an interactive tribute to the loved ones of over 200 of our Kickstarter backers. Can you find hope in the face of death?", "short_description": "An immersive, narrative experience that showcases a scene from the full version of That Dragon, Cancer.  \"Sorry Guys, It's Not Good\" retells a pivotal moment in the Green's journey where they are given the news that Joel is terminal."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.thatdragoncancer.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.thatdragoncancer.com/terms-conditions", "publisher_name": "Numinous Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.thatdragoncancer.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["ADVENTURE", "NARRATIVE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "5051431344877491"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12138991_576317275884716_3341264649667477504_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Cbv8-4JEW3YQ7kNvwH_ZyqL&_nc_oc=AdpzDTbAINkiK_ALgRxBCYJAKDvgX4J-dcNRS2CQ_gT-P61fQO3oshxqYn_6yOI7ULU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR3FlMIKwZqPOw_yfjaCCNPGaryrZ6itAAztMGF_EZdbA&oe=6AFB1B5F"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": fal